                </text>
                <text x="845" y="173" text-anchor="middle" fill="rgba(231, 240, 242, 0.78)" font-size="13" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, ui-monospace">
                  cognition/metabolic
                </text>
                <text x="845" y="191" text-anchor="middle" fill="rgba(16, 217, 138, 0.95)" font-size="13" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, ui-monospace">
                  flexibility (4w)
